            {h:`Plan first`, p:`<p>Listing tasks and estimating time always comes first.</p>`},
            {h:`Review before submitting`, p:`<p>Corrections and proofreading come before the deadline, not after.</p>`},
            {h:`Follow-up comes last`, p:`<p>You can only confirm receipt after you have submitted.</p>`}
